LATE_LOWER: label/index retained; no false progress heartbeat
FORWARD: generated -> hub -> helper; stage/index synchronized; still waiting
SAME_STAGE: no invented progress or re-render
UNKNOWN_STAGE: no replacement of confirmed C1 stage
CANONICAL_FALSE: metadata merged, button removed; no injection or forced move
LATE_TRUE: lower stage cannot restore cancel or overwrite newer reason
SAME_TRUE: denial remains for same delivery
NULL_AND_IDENTITY: absent/null preserve metadata; update cannot replace input body/source/identity/role
SAME_LEGAL_METADATA: explicit fixed reason updated without stage invention
INVALID_METADATA: nonboolean/unknown-status/nonstring-reason ignored
LEGACY_METADATA: no canonical grant/metadata merge
WRONG_DELIVERY: no merge into existing waiting row
EXISTING_MOVE: helper_received/cancelled
EXISTING_MOVE: helper_received/failed
EXISTING_MOVE: cli_injected/NONE
EXISTING_MOVE: pty_write/NONE
EXISTING_MOVE: expired/NONE
EXISTING_MOVE: helper_received/dead
EXISTING_MOVE: helper_received/dropped
COMPLETE: 19 targeted observations; original renderer functions, synthetic DOM only
